      "body": "After a current result arrives through standard `toolresult`, a delayed `openai:set_globals` payload can contain both a stale widget snapshot identity and its matching stale capability. This final disjunct lets that incoming payload prove its own correlation even though neither current identity reference matches; restoration then applies the old view state/tool and may save the old snapshot under the current host ID. Correlate only against an identity already accepted for the displayed result, or verify the incoming widget data against the current fingerprint.",
